{"sym":"NBIS","name":"Nebius Group N.V.","crypto":false,"sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Internet Content & Information","country":"Netherlands","employees":1543,"website":"https://nebius.com","exchange":"NasdaqGS","summary":"Nebius Group N.V., a technology company, engages in building full-stack infrastructure to service the global AI industry in the United States, the United Kingdom, and internationally. It offers Nebius builds full-stack infrastructure for AI, including large-scale GPU clusters, cloud platforms, and tools and services for developers. The company also provides TripleTen, an edtech platform for re-skilling individuals for careers in technolgy; and Avride, which develops autonomous driving technology for self-driving cars and delivery robotics. It has a strategic alliance with NVIDIA Corporation to support the expansion of the company's AI cloud infrastructure. The company was formerly known as Yandex N.V. and changed its name to Nebius Group N.V. in August 2024. Nebius Group N.V. was founded in 1989 and is based in Schiphol, the Netherlands.","ko":{"overview":"네비우스 그룹은 AI 산업을 위한 풀스택 인프라를 구축하는 회사입니다. 대규모 GPU 클러스터와 클라우드 플랫폼이 핵심이며, 엔비디아와 전략적 제휴를 맺고 있습니다. 옛 얀덱스(Yandex N.V.)에서 출발했습니다.","segments":["네비우스 AI 클라우드 (GPU 클러스터)","트리플텐 (IT 재교육 에듀테크)","아브라이드 (자율주행, 배송 로봇)"]},"price":158.74,"prev":159.17,"mc":40303800320,"next":{"date":"2026-11-10","timing":"bmo","ts":"2026-11-10T12:30Z","estimated":false,"eps_avg":-0.6389,"eps_lo":-1.07,"eps_hi":0.31,"rev_avg":905738460,"rev_lo":876600000,"rev_hi":942600000},"fin":{"rev":1355100032,"rev_g":4.54,"eps_g":null,"gm":0.7426,"om":-0.0022,"pm":0.0313,"roe":0.006,"fcf":-9614650368},"val":{"pe":133.39,"fpe":-44.12,"peg":0.49,"ps":29.74,"pb":4.21,"ev_ebitda":177.0,"eps":1.19,"div":0.0},"health":{"cash":8042100224,"debt":10195300352,"de":98.6,"cr":4.03,"short":0.1893,"short_days":3.0,"inst":0.7,"insider":0.034,"beta":1.46,"avg_vol":21111755},"analyst":{"mean":281.0,"lo":84.0,"hi":410.0,"n":20,"key":"buy","dis